    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "AFRICA\nDONG KINGMAN",
      "Cocktailo\nSherry Dubonnet Campari\nManhattan Gin Martini Vodka Martini Vermouth\nBioody Mary Screwdriver Whiskey Sour\nTom Collins Vodka Collins Daiquiri Scotch\nBourbon\nCanadian Gin Vodka Rum Premium Beer\nMenu\nAppetizer\nFruit and Berries Coupe garnished with fresh mint with muscadine sorbet\nEntree\nQuail stuffed with rice and fruit stuffing\nServed with a demi-glaze and julienne vegetables\nSurrounded around plate\nGarlic Cheese Grits\nVegetable\nSquash, carrots, red bell pepper and broccoli\nDessert\nWarm Chocolate Bread Pudding with vanilla sauce\nBeverage\nIced Tea, Coffee, or Orange Juice\nAssorted Breakfast Pastries with butter and marmalade\nFeaturing Regional Specialties\nMuscadine Sorbet - prepared from Muscadine Grapes\nStuffed Quail\nGarlic Cheese Grits",
      "AFRICA\nDong Kingman, the award winning Chinese-American artist, travels the world sketching and painting\nthe beautiful, the monumental and the picturesque. His watercolors grace more than forty\npermanent museum and private collections in the USA and abroad.\nAfrica is a continent of great natural beauty. In addition to abundant wild game it contains a\nmixture of mountains, jungles, magnificent rivers, open plains, and arid deserts.\nMany of its cities are bustling metropolises with broad avenues, modern buildings.\ngood restaurants and fine hotels, including several Inter• Continental Hotels.\nFrom New York, Pan Am 747's serve Dakar, Monrovia, Acera, Lagos, Abidjan, and Nairobi.\nMr. Kingman's painting depicts majestic, snowcapped Mount Kilamanjaro in Tanzania\nAt 19,340 feet it is Africa's highest mountain\nOPAN AM"
    ],
